# Markdown round trips and streamed parses

Handle `$ARGUMENTS`. Active Local CI gate running the real Markdown codec (`createTestEditor` + `BaseIndentPlugin`, math, GFM, CJK-friendly, emoji) over small generated sources and CommonMark/GFM spec examples.

**The property.** Every accepted Markdown source round-trips (`parse -> serialize -> parse`) to the same document across LF/CRLF/CR while preserving front matter and code-fence info strings, and every streamed `parseSlice` continuation matches a fresh parse without unexpected take-backs, hidden text, or lossless drift.

**The harm.** Round-trip drift corrupts saved/AI Markdown, and streaming drift makes streamed AI replies flicker, hide arrived text, or change on finish.

## Run it

- `pnpm check markdown-round-trip` (active Local CI gate; `--light` runs the same gate, <1 min p90): runs `pnpm check:markdown-round-trip` (11,643 cases, `GATE_CASES`) + `bun test ./packages/platejs/scripts/markdown-round-trip-previews.spec.ts`.
- `pnpm check:markdown-round-trip --inline=3 --part=round-trip` or `--blocks=3`: deeper bounds (no baseline).
- `pnpm check:markdown-round-trip --part=<round-trip|stream|spec-stream|prefix>` or `--case='<id>'`: focused run.
- `pnpm check:markdown-round-trip --lower`: shrink `packages/platejs/scripts/markdown-round-trip-baseline.json` after fixes.

Exit 0 passes, 1 reports findings, 2 reports bad flag, crashed worker, unreadable checkpoint, or broken definition excuse.

## Bounds and assumptions

- Gate covers <=2 inline tokens (22-token alphabet), <=2 block forms (21 forms), CommonMark 0.31.2 + 41 GFM examples, 42 front matter files, 34 README raw-HTML shapes, CJK emphasis, and URL edge cases. `markdown-stream-guess` and `markdown-stream-parse` have 0 baseline entries.
- Excludes HTML codec, arbitrary chunkings of inline syntax, plugins outside `createTestEditor`, MDX, front matter in `parseSlice`, YAML/TOML schema validation, and browser UI.

## Bug vs drift

- **Real bug:** valid source or chunking breaks round-trip, continuation parity, or preview bounds. Fix codec and run `--lower`.
- **Modeling error / intended change:** fix `packages/platejs/scripts/markdown-round-trip.ts` with reason (and update `docs/vision/plate.md` if policy changed); never grow baseline.

